#: scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26dd6637c71237cca90eb6e14f15d63f0ca23e387dc187ac48be08e306d1a58f
#. default-sha256: 6e7ab09f110aeeb7d90618bd239f45c6e211b6f1bb040c97f150e22d3abe9501
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫As I am sure "
"you’re aware,⟪k:15⟫our parents arranged our marriage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Come già saprai,"
"⟪k:15⟫le nozze erano state organizzate dai nostri genitori."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e65f5313e42c29474f0a336e176bfa2cee3e9fabc501a00049ddaf4f8a2da584
#. default-sha256: 0b7564221735d24dae6414143cb6d2c5f0af65ebe9eb5ae42112a5dcc8b2bc22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Before I emigrated to this country to be married,⟪k:1⟫I lived in a misty island nation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Prima di emigrare in questo Paese per sposarmi,⟪k:1⟫ho vissuto in uno stato insulare—⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫un’isola particolarmente nebbiosa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cfc10d1e88b2041b1ae70bccf76cf81816ac1ae73fd62d08c1da8e92006fff4
#. default-sha256: 35fc5c8c79101e554fa25c8d09184ccc5c19ad408604155cca84b07c87fc4701
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Portraits of my ancestors hung in the house where I lived; ⟪k:1⟫I remember as a child "
"wincing in fear at the sight of them staring down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nella casa in cui abitavo vi erano appesi alcuni ritratti dei miei antenati; ⟪k:1⟫ricordo "
"che da bambina trasalivo per la paura alla vista di quei volti che mi fissavano."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 197ae15c163d34837e9ff5e96bc7acfae4dd2e700be3e721e3f0397c1baf343c
#. default-sha256: ce36f9eeb13a8216462c01591c65180fbac532340e8fbcb4709ea2db77e4cb4b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mother and father were constantly telling me to show them respect, as it was their hard "
"work that kept our bloodline alive and well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mia madre e mio padre mi dicevano costantemente di portare loro rispetto, poiché era grazie "
"al loro duro lavoro se la nostra stirpe era sopravvissuta."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4436ca5144a6dd6bd4bcd88d2fc944846237ea87fa6491e69e5c98da05ec34b
#. default-sha256: 4a8047d2dc1c6142a5a4e5f5b781e2c428f9750f1f76aaf19404377341ecc968
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, they were fighting an uphill battle to do the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, per fare lo stesso, i miei stavano combattendo una faticosa battaglia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19a76eccf95afcf0634915e491d3320a4b0912cc051c59c2d8a9c4a1dfad53f6
#. default-sha256: 17df6ccf9a1418bd3d5eebb8c158d20412d047a6411a613a937575058e20bc38
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would have been clear to anyone reasonably perceptive that our house was coming tumbling "
"down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sarebbe stato chiaro a chiunque fosse abbastanza perspicace⟪k:1⟫che la nostra famiglia stava "
"crollando."

#: scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 250e900d09f70fa0ba00a80d9be85be5ce577daab8ee995edba813262293c799
#. default-sha256: 7b17f85d3f4044ee9afb6206ff3a35d825d33a942b385ebafe86cdc9a2d4f7d9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Valuable furniture and paintings slowly disappeared, and eventually, the portraits were gone "
"too."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Poco a poco, mobili e quadri preziosi scomparvero,⟪k:1⟫e con loro anche quei ritratti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2b26260c3c752eaf90b83f9e6e6aca9c3848648edf057c01916ae38ffb98fe6
#. default-sha256: 0948a10c6554b3b0fe348794ac55f9eddf6e3767f85ce5ede2c3e1c42b9aedea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As our house collapsed, so too did my parents’ health deteriorate, robbing us of any source "
"of income."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando la nostra stirpe crollò, la salute dei miei genitori si deteriorò, privandoci di "
"qualunque fonte di reddito."

#: scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7633e131b834361ad016cd5b2938be900d7dbc19e60d3a0deabffb1fc37a404
#. default-sha256: 8018db78d54ad9bbdbeac6288b04f21c628af14f5ea5a5e7ec9bbd2a8e069e1e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And though I was educated, I lacked the skills necessary to obtain work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E sebbene fossi istruita, mi mancavano le capacità necessarie per ottenere lavoro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 373ba72cdc469bc8af1803a976539f56d27577c7117f3ccf6afb1ab63ed969d0
#. default-sha256: 50f4e6b0114b21f95610ab2373be2a47d9acb3d5f20021f716d0e21b770959c2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just as we were about to run out of money and options, my parents received Jacopo’s parents’ "
"marriage proposition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Proprio mentre stavamo per esaurire il denaro e le alternative,⟪k:1⟫i miei genitori "
"ricevettero la proposta di matrimonio dai genitori⟪k:2⟫di Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b2f19be3c41f871234d25cb76d52adc32e75d582460409bd3576691a4271983
#. default-sha256: 8d567760abd72a459332742c40c305e5bd189ce29851dac2b7beb97244cbb1b4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Both of our families stood to benefit from the arrangement.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had social status, "
"and he had wealth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Entrambe le nostre famiglie avrebbero tratto beneficio dall’accordo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Io avevo la "
"reputazione, e lui era benestante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a45c5ffff08a0a32e20e2c050e135e29dbf91d22d09040e8f3407569e8771363
#. default-sha256: 4b521f0b62704fa6d528d419f728959db7b96c879ae58e514c611c3f4cf59273
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We each had what the other lacked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ciascuno di noi aveva qualcosa che all’altro mancava."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fdef0193a661a40787ca3e7c3eacc4ef525acf8108cf66c5c979904975fe174
#. default-sha256: a6295d593e5f791701726b389def963fd3fa43260d9a86c8dc8d9e57932ca421
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One needs more than money to make it in the world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Without at least a semi-"
"reputable name attached to you,⟪k:3⟫you’re liable to get laughed out of most social gatherings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per farcela in questo mondo serve ben più del denaro.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Senza reputazione, si rischia "
"di essere malvisti e derisi durante gli eventi sociali."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3d6cc653031d8b8f6ac747be8d1761d31eba9a4ff445b9e1978a239cc6521e7
#. default-sha256: 1bcc5d3603324fd8ea8782b81d489252c654887a22bc3b64742de080046a030f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I first met Jacopo here, in this country.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We didn’t even know what the other looked "
"like until our wedding day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ qui che ho incontrato Jacopo la prima volta, in questo Paese.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Prima del "
"giorno del nostro matrimonio, non sapevamo nemmeno⟪k:5⟫che aspetto avesse l’altro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2224ec46df43636182e6873a7379e098b10e2255a9b6db3e19ef3a6c7732d9e0
#. default-sha256: 255f95bb26c345e52312170085c03aea63fdffbc24b347181d34ae9799496627
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To be quite honest, I was scared to death at first.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was so nervous. What kind of "
"man would he be?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was I to be wed to some middle-aged stranger?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Onestamente, all’inizio ero spaventata a morte.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ero così nervosa.⟪k:3⟫ Che tipo di "
"uomo poteva essere?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Avrei dovuto sposare uno sconosciuto di mezza età?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fde982db6714c6e25e1fdf7d65939b610043358df587fd12f6c5e3ff853d4098
#. default-sha256: 9d885a566c3e11bf54877102f53707a7b6078a17b78b1d74f65e7983f128ada6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were not marrying because we had fallen in love like a normal couple."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non ci stavamo sposando perché eravamo innamorati come una coppia normale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 938cdb84b6cc057c91763dddbb482b76d4442941040f49dad6b6e098b9c94b77
#. default-sha256: bbb6d78782e1375a9bb71fa0df438113ba681503e902fa343c564cc5a868513b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I was in no position to be concerned with such things,⟪k:1⟫but when I thought about "
"our future, I shook with fear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sapevo di non essere nella posizione per preoccuparmi di queste cose,⟪k:1⟫ma ogni volta che "
"pensavo al nostro futuro, tremavo per la paura."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36cedecd185a63f0fa22b59bed2888eddf232dbb8be3abdef92bf183a919386e
#. default-sha256: aeefe5369780219bf3fd413a132d6c206d0e6f2d6d872c4a22cea6952bad0fb6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the man I saw through my veil at the wedding was remarkable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, l’uomo che vidi attraverso il velo, il giorno del nostro matrimonio, era "
"meraviglioso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78fe97eec3613406d28c8f0f8de5630ed0cf6b6bc1d001494ecb5e5fbdebf3c6
#. default-sha256: 8d381c7dcda1737967d8ed51941c80c9ef8c542042f804bd367fe62353030f3e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was young, had strong, masculine eyes,⟪k:1⟫and at the same time, he too appeared nervous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era giovane, aveva occhi decisi e mascolini,⟪k:1⟫e allo stesso tempo anche lui appariva "
"nervoso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 140aacbb2c4343d0fd4d94b7f2f63dde6952cd82f8761dc17b9c62aa82ec278e
#. default-sha256: 87a2adac462a80a56e875823e8ddd145aa990b0910344e979462a8c468ed4f7f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫He was shaking as much—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫no, even more than me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Tremava tanto quanto me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫anzi, ⟪k:4⟫più⟪k:5⟫ di me."

#: scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d2f96e9a6c04f46daafc5e102fa883f32aad024e4b37ce5bc002333dae4962c
#. default-sha256: 1a8de16df1b997091305ac092287140d8da8bbc4ccbfcd676f32db4646c21b34
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing that, the priest gave an impish little smirk when he asked Jacopo if he vowed his "
"eternal love to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vedendolo, il sacerdote sorrise maliziosamente mentre chiedeva a Jacopo se avrebbe giurato "
"il suo eterno amore per me."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6537047988db6354d2fbd44511f9b4f6c8de21c7828aa97560381e1ce98b841a
#. default-sha256: 0826f97046b792339d38ac8b8728246e161a756edbc5540d818a8479d9e75091
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫counted myself among the happy. ⟪k:2⟫And I still do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For in that moment, "
"I experienced true love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Io... ⟪k:1⟫mi ritenevo felice. ⟪k:2⟫E continuo a farlo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Perché in quel momento, ho "
"conosciuto il vero amore."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd0a1170eb1db3e96f54678197acbb6cce65ab2f254716bd979383e4db20fbf4
#. default-sha256: 61b4b51353ce46b12851284b29c4a5f571839dea2294f14befff3ba42578826d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You wanted to hear about when he was kind to me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well, after the wedding, we "
"were given a week to ourselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Volevi sapere di quando lui era gentile con me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ebbene, dopo le nozze, ci venne "
"concessa una settimana per stare⟪k:3⟫da soli."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8514270fba67f2df58170b50500582c53058eda83f0bb6a5044d6f2269fa9f29
#. default-sha256: 748846dfee01c88d68ed9c30d7a57fa7dfa465996099b7dadbbd5046e1598bc3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suppose you could call it a honeymoon, though we didn’t take a trip overseas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or "
"even go very far at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Suppongo che la si potrebbe chiamare luna di miele, anche se non avevamo viaggiato "
"oltreoceano—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫né eravamo andati tanto lontani."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3545ABA_5D3E_4590_BE8E_3ADF12576978
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a089164e6b405f182067a94e2bd9cff31e89503a77d3f970c5db4dbeb37bb63e
#. default-sha256: 2a16e15a29a20d4f4d654e4a2d2692c3374ec2c8c06666c345a1f179c740d9b4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3545ABA_5D3E_4590_BE8E_3ADF12576978"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He looked at me with uncertainty and asked:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mi guardò con incertezza, chiedendomi:"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8D48F148_7278_46E4_8DF7_4D8AACB4C7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
