msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He hurriedly climbed into the carriage he had called for, a look of "
"frustrated displeasure on his face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Si affrettò a salire sulla carrozza che aveva chiamato,⟪k:6⟫con "
"un’espressione frustrata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0188FDA6_E178_40AB_9137_0037D28147C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85cfec4b468deea07514d7ef7c4b03cbfc8f74bd98676dcb29567efb37463cd4
