msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0188FDA6_E178_40AB_9137_0037D28147C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then, as if he had forgotten about me until that moment,⟪k:1⟫he returned, grabbed me by "
"the arm, and led me to the carriage.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In retrospect, I realize he was not being very "
"gentlemanly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E poi, come se si fosse dimenticato di me fino a quel momento,⟪k:1⟫tornò indietro, mi "
"afferrò per un braccio e mi condusse fino alla carrozza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C30CAAF0_A587_4AFF_A995_99B62A48DEAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ceae9865c026ef95ebf94f80118e772d51bb6059cfd29f3af53dcf9c7dba799
#. default-sha256: 275607641ddddfa66be615431fd3201b5ace79e85e412681424bb4147b057bbc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C30CAAF0_A587_4AFF_A995_99B62A48DEAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I was pleased that he was making any attempt to interact with me at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ripensandoci, mi rendo conto che non era un gran gentiluomo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma ero contenta che le "
"stesse provando tutte pur di interagire con me."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81975920_F28C_42F2_A838_235574DC5766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48bd4f61e153c3730b2c133a32d75f6da6b4ca60b1c7badf9cd9b1990add4805
#. default-sha256: 495dce5a3f1b8945fc6dd0a716c9af9576122ad84db3c378586051cdf8861741
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81975920_F28C_42F2_A838_235574DC5766"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As the carriage trotted down the streets, I saw so many new things. ⟪k:4⟫I "
"had spent most of my time cooped up inside at home, so it was like stepping into an entirely new "
"world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mentre la carrozza percorreva le strade, vidi tante cose nuove.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Avevo trascorso gran parte del mio tempo rinchiusa in casa,⟪k:6⟫quindi fu come mettere piede in "
"un mondo completamente nuovo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9587d8d48d701327ad9a416446a21fe44dbcb43fda696caaf019630e88526087
#. default-sha256: 852fcb868142b15d246ebe110f081406a053ef955130daea6b301ff36530e4bb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And add to that the rapid industrial advancement currently taking place. I saw men shouting "
"back and forth as they smacked newspaper articles with the backs of their hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E a ciò si aggiungeva il rapido progresso industriale tuttora in corso.⟪k:1⟫Vidi uomini "
"gridare in ogni direzione mentre colpivano gli articoli di giornale col dorso delle mani."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ACA8EC42_591F_41E2_8D16_DA7FC376D6C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c725578da29ed09f7d23160bc10550da2a520532af983efb9ae81db0c28749cb
#. default-sha256: e5cb7282e829041f02640d4128db35d059a8263d52bca83ee0f740bec88d4c50
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ACA8EC42_591F_41E2_8D16_DA7FC376D6C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I saw corner cafés crowded with cigar-smoking men on break from work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vidi bar agli angoli delle strade, gremiti di uomini che fumavano⟪k:1⟫in pausa dal lavoro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3E770804_C359_4AD0_9005_C149A830FD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 317c3cc3c0d35f409d5df658ca135e9698c979b817b2770d631e8d30ec68c85b
#. default-sha256: 5b842ba2abd3be121fd2c84a05bbf258edf3e91559cdf458411b02cbda1eaa22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3E770804_C359_4AD0_9005_C149A830FD99"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was like the hustle and bustle of a festival."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sembrava la baraonda di una qualche festa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f8641af2a3c1966faa684e811164241571c72c3087fd792267013f486bbb6ce
#. default-sha256: 419a3db61433630f5661038caa709485e338a73a7df36036dae1deb9a1cd3a36
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every festival has its underside.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I also saw overworked men, looking like they "
"were on the verge of collapse, drinking water from a spigot on the side of the road."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma ogni festa ha il proprio lato nascosto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vidi anche uomini sovraccarichi di "
"lavoro, che sembravano sull’orlo del collasso, e che bevevano acqua da un rubinetto sul ciglio "
"della strada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfdf7bd5ed906dc9a8a6ab56c211e357fbd387f3b1e2c7f5f39f9856eab14b5b
#. default-sha256: ebdfa641c1aaf5c8e4f1cef864894fd1911469414d55a7fc9d8f78120f8bf034
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By way of contrast, I wore fine clothing and had a carriage at my disposal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Al contrario, io indossavo abiti eleganti,⟪k:1⟫e avevo una carrozza a mia disposizione."

#: scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2820e0b1c72ed5b2746445fb9a2c067eb0017c0fa9fe9760cc0e38c257c275b
