msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I imagine every day was a struggle for them just to remain afloat."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Immagino che per loro ogni giorno fosse una lotta per rimanere a galla."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7475561a5c8f249a88c6cc714932e868a4eb8a2ab269c78fa7891a079c8e6744
#. default-sha256: 05eb403646a69a76d51b92096d3a9394798493073f906aff452c5abcfa045be8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had I not married the man I had, I too might have found myself on the streets in a similar "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se non avessi sposato quell’uomo, anch’io mi sarei potuta ritrovare per strada in una "
"situazione analoga."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a570d7ea14da8b2eb1d404173e33c98124157180744e96c51e02a79cac7e692
#. default-sha256: 3159a86e20c24eb3fc8095af8585d19ee11acbd466f0718f55b4977c02fb0388
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not relief that spread through my breast at the sight of them—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was "
"pangs of guilt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non era sollievo ciò che si espandeva dentro di me alla vista di quegli uomini—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"era senso di colpa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c06fb7386afcd623ac7acfdf79d393be0c333631471330c2b623651ae1f50b2d
#. default-sha256: d58d088c90cf74067bff86939908539ee844502f9c073b290ecf340946662160
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It felt to me like a life of opulence was wrong—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sinful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sentivo come se una vita nel lusso fosse sbagliata—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫peccaminosa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb0148360b40f79cacf13451ce5e42bd6f8cc30a8065715b81eba0a66df0aa1f
#. default-sha256: a12ad66a1f913eed605b66faebac9c21a05e9c342c2048d1fc9868b4ed6b8905
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It broke my heart to know that I was living so much better than them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mi spezzava il cuore sapere che vivevo molto meglio di loro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 173ab2a05c46ae74b98f70aa11cf7713f45c6bfc328222e749298d69110d55df
#. default-sha256: 8f99c95999598553cbadf8da7a3959766509c88c005907c490ffba6fc3cf2035
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo snorted disapprovingly at me,⟪k:1⟫seemingly reading my mind, and then said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo sbuffò in segno di disapprovazione,⟪k:1⟫come se mi avesse letto nel pensiero, e poi "
"disse,"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8305ef3e87a6fba420c08c04239f3eaa5d86241776c722856ea77bedc5294f19
#. default-sha256: eebe5abd60eaf9ec4e5a4189023810468cbb40fbca8113e7395530278dcc32ef
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The poor man who envies the rich, covets his wealth, and finds the ambition to make the same "
"for himself; and the rich man who pities the poor, thinking it his duty to give them offerings of "
"philanthropy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il povero che invidia i ricchi, bramando la loro fortuna, e che trova l’ambizione di fare lo "
"stesso per se stesso; e il ricco che prova pena⟪k:1⟫per i poveri, pensando che sia suo dovere "
"offrire loro la propria solidarietà."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c01d7fa3d47c04ae8336993669a9fae8007984e10f65655822305eccb459e753
#. default-sha256: c6657522dc33e723c5b55724cb9ec49a554c24a2d5ad3a7fe8657fca9268db53
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To me, the latter is the far more nefarious.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Excessive charity will ruin a man—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫make him come to ⟪k:5⟫expect⟪k:6⟫ handouts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Secondo me, il secondo è molto meno onorevole.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L’eccessiva carità rovina un uomo—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lo porta ad aspettarsi altro sostegno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc28ae3440a452c765ae296606f90ebeec2e8ca430d7c78162e006cd9f2c8f36
#. default-sha256: 0a8cd59fd6da83e495e556ff99a6d44181916c95d6854d8a42b4b0b2215e308a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there are those with the wrong idea of pity,⟪k:1⟫who let themselves fall down to "
"the same place,⟪k:2⟫mistakenly believing it will somehow make the poor feel better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E poi ci sono quelli che hanno un’idea sbagliata di pietà,⟪k:1⟫che continuano a commettere "
"lo stesso errore,⟪k:2⟫credendo che in qualche modo questo farà sentire meglio i poveri."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0048d7a1f255dac1630fc5bc617b71c1138b365b04134af2cb71f11f8e2f6d16
#. default-sha256: fe0a17cf10e7444b7a8092682a511db73b55ace3ad799d6d7fbad35eec71ad60
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What a joke.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re going to do anything for them,⟪k:3⟫you might as well "
"encourage them to climb upward.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Spur on economic growth and the flow of capital."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Che idiozia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se hai intenzione di fare qualcosa per loro,⟪k:3⟫potresti "
"incoraggiarli a puntare in alto.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Incentivare la crescita economica e il flusso di "
"capitali."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d85caaa93540c29472152c1e11af1a8ad34e6c3f03910918930f6110bec6cb56
#. default-sha256: 209d9a933353f4da674398c3e673233f94a9e38f94da5b1baf17eccbf552603d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t that sound like the better option?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non ti sembra la scelta migliore?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35722c0843003044a7ab7a03b39cac9e2e13fbf0c672d56a9e23d88b4fa5e6ab
#. default-sha256: 48bbef5098a32a6c34b08b3a9ee698778c6fd56077832d0f4dbba0c8bc63ae2f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say nothing, simply smiling and giving an ambiguous nod."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non dissi nulla; mi limitai a sorridere, annuendo vagamente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d451a2d5dfccbc6bec3fcb54e826a6879350bdbef4cb88bcf721af662913ab2
#. default-sha256: a484b2042387564c8076aa6a710f5b992b4b58ee892b9e120629cc1613ded418
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had a point—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫my sympathy and guilt meant nothing to people actually experiencing "
"hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Su una cosa aveva ragione—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫la mia comprensione e il mio senso di colpa non avevano "
"alcun valore per coloro che stavano davvero vivendo delle difficoltà."

#: scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08c841898d68370b6c481698d89b3b6bd52be1f030686c10618eef12a875dfb8
#. default-sha256: b1d2115a28e940c71814a3dff3de3b2841994794917af37c13619d2593eb7921
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If, feeling guilty of my own fortune, I acted upon that pity in the way he had described, it "
"would accomplish little more than self-satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se avessi agito per pietà nel modo da lui descritto, sentendomi in colpa per la mia fortuna, "
"non avrei ottenuto altro che autocompiacimento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8624c7fd30c01c38d270d61b611ac50af34a5bafcf9ad2ffa99a5158b901eb9c
#. default-sha256: e27a01ad9d51120576d4167873bbafb83269110e5d3be3d58e765f0358060ae3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to have seen straight through to my very core."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sembrava che mi avesse guardato dritto nel profondo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8c1a63879bf12779bc8ef96f668a7a8231bb17a5660193b114fb2e960c22152
#. default-sha256: bde769a3bf655aa892fc9183f4ed26534c9ac9e66261067fb6e956652a3d9b24
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was a man who had built his own fortune through investment, which I imagine required "
"him to be rather astute."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era un uomo che aveva costruito la propria fortuna attraverso gli investimenti, e immagino "
"che questo richiedesse una certa astuzia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2861110cb087c58585fe9dbb8893dfa3242345f22f21c394c0f3f89e6fcfc294
#. default-sha256: ba18472752af06867bef568446fcf6c42dfcaf86544dd5cbc457dc427e6db30e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But doesn’t a world where everyone is constantly trying to climb higher and higher sound "
"rather... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫exhausting?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma un mondo in cui ognuno cerca costantemente di arrampicarsi sempre più in alto, non suona "
"così... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫estenuante?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca6f969938395b5b5a31d129369a09f93e0deeb0bf3dbe5de179d6813eff0956
#. default-sha256: cf25b331204c3a3ebe25e48b61b92b159cf13c502f4edda8be481b14bd89cde8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, would prefer to be in a position where I could watch—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if only from a "
"distance—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as others climbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Personalmente, preferirei essere in una posizione in cui potrei guardare gli altri "
"arrampicarsi, anche se solo da lontano."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75b95e0decb8241ff0eabc35c34846b663e1d783e79200b131da831aea505f6f
#. default-sha256: fdd80e8a1ab5ead0ddf9ec327fad193d07d03f9112c487284e3d8fa4b1700d4b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But obviously, I could not say as much to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma ovviamente, questo non potevo dirglielo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47f09eafea85100359a3e395523258433e99b6a0cbe3f25df6eadb6761cc1141
#. default-sha256: 8c7813c95ffcc80eb82adf169cc84d5cf0a5a50523abec879c347f1204a75b5e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Some time later, the carriage came to a stop in front of a shop."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dopo un po’, la carrozza si fermò di fronte a un negozio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7a86fee227a088a845a387d56d99116e03a00ab42f492ccd348c5e1eb9cacaf
#. default-sha256: 22e1e80f8c675bf685b534589b180a135624b07ea6c79c01ea4e039ee831ae95
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I looked at the building perplexedly, he gestured to the door with his chin, signaling "
"for me to get out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mentre guardavo perplessa l’edificio, lui mi indicò lo sportello con un cenno del capo, "
"suggerendomi di uscire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 341dd8f113bf06c94973787e5535d5c362a8914e7f494f8d23441e76dc64bbc7
#. default-sha256: c1cfdff2f29d860849168cd0e5f1aa1cc92aff31e49941a3b1fe722a4e7d3ad6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lost and confused, I stepped down from the carriage,⟪k:1⟫and before me spread a showcase "
"behind a large glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Persa e confusa, scesi dal carro, e davanti a me apparve un grande scaffale dietro una larga "
"vetrata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3ca504f449059ee0ac9eaaf6c8cce44dd02ea25261f0fdf0b3bc6a4ff8c7b99
#. default-sha256: 744b16a373622835d9ec9c00f23fcc4374a8450ca8a2bfff788e062b0a929aaf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, lined up in the case were not precious metals or expensive clothing, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"machines."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, allineati sui ripiani non vi erano gioielli preziosi o vestiti costosi, ⟪k:1⟫bensì "
"delle macchine."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8be5810d40343b21adbcb64693bb70f4e5986efb73d4de637ea7e36cec403eb6
#. default-sha256: d92219a5d80800cfa0d9da5537ed795ba10492a0b8ae0200797d57d607bece6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At first, I had no idea what kind of devices they were."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫All’inizio, non avevo idea di che dispositivi fossero."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8A105800_7BFB_4FAD_A2F3_F81F309E90F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e30d0c66160a3b3909e47b771ddcaf6d60f9e13cd018137cdbc690a7bdba925
#. default-sha256: fb78ce5289610bd136d04a55023acf06df234a44d17b7231cf833c5deec40bc7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8A105800_7BFB_4FAD_A2F3_F81F309E90F6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Have you never had your photo taken before?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ti sei mai fatta fare una foto?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3ACF441F_3E8B_4A94_8048_A1BBE4B15EEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5362adce4161c6334a5aa2217cbb3f41fe1b99dc859bf819173099ef604cf41
#. default-sha256: 1e2d5d58ccdc8ce8975198cea25e856176b7662205b526fef3f308f00974eb3a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3ACF441F_3E8B_4A94_8048_A1BBE4B15EEE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫N-⟪k:2⟫No. I have had a portrait painted, though...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Are these machines for "
"taking photographs?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫N-⟪k:2⟫No. ⟪k:3⟫Però mi sono fatta fare un ritratto...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Queste macchine servono "
"per scattare fotografie?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_44144CC4_05DC_4B1B_8225_6C5DEFDC4A79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 660e763d1c7509d01f7c8557eb2830f90262b367170aa5359cf42177333795e9
#. default-sha256: 0b795a2ca700045829bdd42c406e7ba931b1a701502d730336a8d2fcf0e425f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_44144CC4_05DC_4B1B_8225_6C5DEFDC4A79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A portrait, eh?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why am I not surprised?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un ritratto, eh?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Perché non sono sorpreso?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_455B22F7_27BC_4453_872D_2409482E44F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 688c251791b6be0121e514a7a873811ba627398822cfdd9b027779458f00fe59
#. default-sha256: 6ab623c1a8ad685d78795581caf2f3773e6e54e3e6ae204134882350c758ce82
