msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not drawings, but photographs?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Fotografie al posto di disegni?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0C761822_45C3_4A2E_8B67_DB0ABEAC218D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd374d4396fabdfa9ecca46f3c59ca7b4a908b3de64cf3cce96077cf4b6d4f51
#. default-sha256: 7e802d10bf16a3b0229667958ea3922f9292561f531ba801fb8bb982073b1033
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0C761822_45C3_4A2E_8B67_DB0ABEAC218D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Yes, photos. ⟪k:1⟫By taking hundreds, or perhaps thousands of photographs, it would be "
"possible to reproduce the world as we see it—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫this room, people walking down the streets."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Già. ⟪k:1⟫Mettendo insieme centinaia, forse migliaia di fotografie,⟪k:2⟫sarebbe possibile "
"riprodurre il mondo così come lo vediamo—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫questa stanza, o le persone che camminano "
"per strada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61F941F3_DC33_407C_90A1_157D608FF5BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fb1174f0b9fc758ad1c989acb6877755e503d0fc1987797bb1dfb161c13a33b
#. default-sha256: 511cdaf2b8995d2e9b8f399cafcd08d278ed11badccd2135154348724fa31abf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_61F941F3_DC33_407C_90A1_157D608FF5BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s no point in recording boring, everyday life, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re gonna leave "
"a record of anything behind,⟪k:3⟫it should be the projects and enterprises that move nations."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non ha senso documentare la vita noiosa di tutti i giorni.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se vuoi lasciarti "
"dietro qualcosa, dovrebbero essere i progetti e le imprese che muovono le nazioni."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E581FE29_0CF4_425E_A5AC_87A5D5586C89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bde80cee12bf340372a1160724f4d0f6d856167d889d3a33b8d2ca93aa4904dc
