msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you don’t want it, that’s fine too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Just make your decision quickly.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫You’re making the driver wait."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se non lo vuoi, va bene lo stesso.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma deciditi in fretta.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Stai "
"facendo aspettare il cocchiere."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A0750B8_7526_48A5_B10B_BEC654A660EF
