msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Having said that, Jacopo exited the shop. ⟪k:4⟫I alternated between looking "
"at his back and the phenakis wheel, debating what I wanted to do."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Detto ciò, Jacopo uscì dal negozio.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Mi alternavo tra il guardare la "
"sua schiena e il fenachistoscopio,⟪k:6⟫discutendo con me stessa su cosa volessi fare."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BCEABBE_8021_408C_B45B_5B064B66E68E
