msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Little while back, he came to my shop asking if I could make a phenakistoscope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Poco tempo fa, è venuto qui in negozio chiedendomi se avrei potuto realizzare un "
"fenachistoscopio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D299A1E5_558D_40C0_AF98_9A8049309BDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2789dafe2a62412e6fca348f9694b0baecdbf065710209136020ca7543fc5f3a
#. default-sha256: ba1dadf386c8224954569e38303042e5178e84bef1071d1a3001cff7276d10eb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D299A1E5_558D_40C0_AF98_9A8049309BDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ about knocked me outta my chair!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He’s a man who almost never "
"asks for favors."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quello sì⟪k:2⟫ che mi ha fatto quasi cadere dalla sedia!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ un uomo "
"che non chiede quasi mai favori."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B2069696_8198_4892_833E_CF906E7D1034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2114c2093eddeda4912eaed957ca6f50befaaa0fe4b2ad83d78f771679946d84
#. default-sha256: 25d8333ea5dbc24c6a318ba6c80dd1d0a3992a17820f5f70c3a3c692cb96869c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B2069696_8198_4892_833E_CF906E7D1034"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s pretty damn brusque and he’s got a tongue sharp enough to cut steel, but he’s not "
"wicked to his core—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I swear it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ dannatamente brusco e ha una lingua abbastanza affilata da tagliare l’acciaio, "
"ma in fondo non è malvagio—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫glielo assicuro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7FFBE68_47A9_439F_AA03_4B2F1C3DE410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d02ac83fc8e3c3dd614e6809adb3d383d27d7ea315e34554d9a84ba4503cf650
#. default-sha256: 937993739732a76514daebcdc0a32ab738e202f10f327e9bc53476c7c004905b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7FFBE68_47A9_439F_AA03_4B2F1C3DE410"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So please, ma’am, be a pillar of support for him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Per cui, madam, la prego di essere un pilastro per lui."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98C292A7_C21E_4D5A_B22F_BBBF6202FDC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
