msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3ADD382_6DBA_4008_BD2C_085E5349AA46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I agreed with the owner—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo was not a ⟪k:3⟫bad⟪k:4⟫ man.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He merely had "
"difficulty expressing himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Concordai col negoziante—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo non era un uomo malvagio.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Aveva solo "
"difficoltà ad esprimersi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9391D42B_4DFD_4122_80A1_D807F73929C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07ce86cd7c8f1494fe42b4fba4cb0b0cacab37dd26d6c5e65e05855af280f8dd
