msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7060EA44_6486_431E_9BE5_104C6DD809B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He glanced over at me for a moment, then turned back toward the window and muttered, “yeah.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi guardò per un momento, e poi si girò nuovamente verso il finestrino, mormorando, “Certo”."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BA2FD31B_CE8C_495A_A583_F8AD51B1CBFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86ab0101f2299ff5442b451e65bae5efb349443a5c8f954b5fcc3f6c3e3620b9
#. default-sha256: 5096d2a875e515d1bca0aba73cfe5d014f7dbd23fe87c117cd9073a0921216db
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BA2FD31B_CE8C_495A_A583_F8AD51B1CBFB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫From there, we went to a restaurant for dinner."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Da lì, andammo a cenare in un ristorante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_20E7C46F_CC16_486C_AA4B_BC363AF22D4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24f260c8c3330879103eef0014a958832001056d0317c38b90e11dfa2bb377ee
#. default-sha256: 23f022bc372052e55c0f2035edadd6fe2a2609e44299cafa0576126b6fff7d46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_20E7C46F_CC16_486C_AA4B_BC363AF22D4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You call this a pizza?! The crust is an atrocity!⟪k:1⟫It’s like I’m chewing on rubber!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“E questa la chiamate pizza! L’impasto è atroce!⟪k:1⟫Mi sembra di star masticando della "
"gomma!”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0f0961def4a74a95cb380a7b6239de4f8f77219b0994ac2d98059105377af80
#. default-sha256: e44081c3caff8b43dd73455b832be0bf6b1b5a4e349878c40e27fce935b2f81d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“How can you wave my country’s flag and not serve spaghetti?!⟪k:1⟫Do you have any shame at "
"all?!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Come potete far sventolare la bandiera del mio Paese⟪k:1⟫e non servire spaghetti?!⟪k:2⟫ Non "
"vi vergognate?!”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ba710508ecfa780fa9baaeed9db3159d711f97291d89d14df2b13ff368b64b7
#. default-sha256: aec3bb2a5927281c9753be7397dc4eebe344f77d40417fb9a997782e78d11113
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This wine is pitifully unbalanced! Far too high levels of acidity.⟪k:1⟫Listen to me "
"carefully—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the house wine is the face of a restaurant.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Questo vino è dannatamente sbilanciato!⟪k:1⟫Ha un livello fin troppo elevato di acidità."
"⟪k:2⟫Ascoltatemi attentamente—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫il vino della casa è il volto di un ristorante.”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 962e51a413b1a8ecf338b03c27ac57ea7dfa6653bf98c541dc11f2fedfd85439
#. default-sha256: c31033d6d1f2cdc8aea442757a02188dbe3a3e32c42e9b849a0d8f789a4c1ff6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He complained about every little thing.⟪k:1⟫It was a complete disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si lamentava per ogni piccola cosa.⟪k:1⟫Fu un disastro totale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98c45fcfbd9d8e820048c7a4e18927fa89da5fe4f0b978513ef176ab83d8b8f4
#. default-sha256: 6e150a402ca04c4d0cf72285910faaf72b39a812e59cfbc2710dd5b425a44185
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But curiously enough, I was not at all put off by his behavior."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma stranamente, non ero affatto scoraggiata dal suo comportamento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f0284aa40e36e4f12b2281ea75aa046893c42d2a3691f0c88118b5c7df95be6
#. default-sha256: f9c686b1a2f1afdd6a85dcec4e9bad853928e620d95108a61085980a1305ec75
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When the sun set, the carriage made its way to a nearby hill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quando il sole tramontò, la carrozza si diresse verso una collina vicina."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b9216a2b740c36f67691b9b45e83c85d67ca53028a2dad2ce65b5bd47f07f2b
#. default-sha256: 8fb9658b44ff52b4b9f567c3d13954d5381d6079b0227021ebb9c4f72913b1ee
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cool nighttime breeze felt wonderful on my skin, flushed from the alcohol, and the light "
"from the gas lamps had a comforting warmth to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La fresca brezza notturna dava una sensazione meravigliosa sulla pelle arrossata dall’alcol, "
"e la luce delle lampade a gas donava un calore confortante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5edfd7ffa6de96365b64d6c600be7ba52f07aea6820872cbacc9e6f988928367
#. default-sha256: a3349961b4c8d2b443d560b952b8d63aa666bdf741527130255dbd4bda92e88d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Jacopo had complained about the quality of the wine, once he had intoxicated himself, "
"his mood improved visibly. ⟪k:1⟫It made him unexpectedly talkative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene Jacopo si fosse lamentato della qualità del vino,⟪k:1⟫una volta ubriaco, il suo "
"umore migliorò visibilmente.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Lo rese inaspettatamente loquace."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19cc4ba7a8a1955ad18dbff89d75d2e38fee627151275d76e67aab944667d5be
#. default-sha256: 2bbad1e7b28380981b6958cf339c05a5b1375dcafb613225768363c7b61be898
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Look out at the city.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A gloomy town that shuts "
"down at night isn’t suited to expansion or growth. But this city isn’t like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Osserva la città.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Una città cupa che si spegne "
"di notte non è adatta all’espansione⟪k:10⟫e alla crescita. Ma questa città non è affatto così."

#: scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86f130943e670b1316a7958add0fb5b4d5fd0471c828563fa010863549b8ba15
#. default-sha256: de9497368990ad4a6c325318c117bb1f234ce68b4b58736819b086cd2c6b8324
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You can see people walking beneath the lamps,⟪k:1⟫and you can hear the bustle of them "
"talking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Puoi vedere persone che camminano sotto i lampioni,⟪k:1⟫e udire il loro mormorio mentre "
"parlano."

#: scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f08c467558a7810ad400fffa79bcb86f20c2b2995b709fa4a765830a4585c1a2
#. default-sha256: 634a6b5161b26e29df8d0cbee399d26586ec4bf3e7cad793ff95f15ab7884e64
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is a city that still has plenty of room to grow.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As they ride the rising wave "
"of the economy,⟪k:3⟫many, many more people will gather here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questa città ha ancora un ampio margine di miglioramento.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cavalcando l’onda "
"crescente dell’economia, si riuniranno molte più persone qui."

#: scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b20160b01144e2c29cb3249e46de964d17d699c8a56c628b50c63711bc6dd3c
#. default-sha256: 3a7f56f1eda70ccb05ca2dda40eb4d5d747acb9d1eece15071263583cbd7e09c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More people means more money in circulation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫More money in circulation means the "
"city grows,⟪k:3⟫companies are founded, and more goods are bought and sold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Più persone significa più denaro in circolazione.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Più denaro circola e più la città "
"crescerà;⟪k:3⟫verranno fondate compagnie, e verranno acquistati e venduti più beni."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 930b2d72a5f4b0cad006a034351d84e1aec10582033a4980ff33033973c696fc
