msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Will it really change so drastically?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cambierà veramente così tanto?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d54d3d6e2f59656dcad15037816bc77b3fbdd425c51535c41ca6cdf9afdd183a
#. default-sha256: 2a49ebf5841ff1045717322ac6641b772752ab03cc268db4034a6831ce2c0aec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It can be difficult to see what’s happening from the inside.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The majority of "
"people just go about their daily lives,⟪k:4⟫and the next thing they know, things are different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Può essere difficile vedere cosa succede dall’interno.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Gran parte delle "
"persone si limitano a vivere le proprie vite,⟪k:4⟫e prima che se ne rendano conto, le cose sono "
"cambiate."

#: scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e77e07da1fa3cc255267b1caab683bff84a89f82063a6b3d74acf0a2ddcce37c
#. default-sha256: e5ba9dc52c69158141b5a0307829827685582091f7873e1f42f8cdd1417f09a9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’d wager most don’t notice the changes at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Anzi—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫scommetto che la maggior parte di loro non nota affatto⟪k:4⟫i "
"cambiamenti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C6C73090_D254_45AD_A1CB_9FE8662CAAFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 524ff82a48b85b8826e28a175f9fe88215e62ba306df4922a35d4dcc6a484bc8
#. default-sha256: 0317f135d33428a321938768194ac827cb7bc2a503761f92f18d95301f176a2d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C6C73090_D254_45AD_A1CB_9FE8662CAAFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only those with eyes sharp enough to realize what’s happening can seize success. ⟪k:2⟫I "
"cannot afford to overlook even the most minute change."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Solo chi è abbastanza acuto da capire cosa sta succedendo può cogliere il successo. "
"⟪k:2⟫Non posso permettermi di trascurare nemmeno la più piccola variazione."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29F2513_568B_450D_B77C_A53EDD33F045
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93f55ae2b4e632c21e4af269cdfbf23e3ec6dd717aefa540ec14756d65155233
