msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you have... ⟪k:2⟫a dream of some kind?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hai... ⟪k:2⟫un sogno di qualche tipo?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CECB563B_414E_41C5_B847_5E0AD4392C78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 602d1c6a373a46a214dd08ef9c2ced771032890de13799ae38a7034894a6c974
#. default-sha256: 295cca2765268f0cf7ac3a8366f78d47066ffa6f371c0d176c77d1402249b585
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CECB563B_414E_41C5_B847_5E0AD4392C78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A dream? I’m not sure if it’s easy enough to attain to call a dream. ⟪k:2⟫Others might "
"call it greed—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or perhaps ambition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un sogno? ⟪k:2⟫Non sono sicuro se sia abbastanza fattibile da poterlo chiamare sogno. "
"⟪k:3⟫Altri potrebbero chiamarla avidità—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫o forse ambizione."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A6B61D0F_0F48_4645_A129_7AB9539C130F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11cc96ddb490f7e9d384a714e7f248f009c74e98b8ff82f055d9b1fb797befc5
