msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A6B61D0F_0F48_4645_A129_7AB9539C130F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t laugh, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My intention... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is to make the world mine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ti prego di non ridere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ciò che voglio... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫è che il mondo sia mio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1F5A7FC2_1014_4BFD_BB44_B3C7137C281A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bf6f33246b4f596be8765109a27a3cfdb5ee37deb1b826afac9b43af500ef19
