msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sei consapevole che io, come te, sono un immigrato, giusto?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_72DFF2CA_DE97_4C72_86C1_4534482B68C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25a7f610ceb8fd2fe8adfa75348d01709555d717edd00729f9c4d345a361871e
#. default-sha256: b02a4e4865935fb21c8ff27c2b53bef078063381af9bdb5da45f17d31071e850
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72DFF2CA_DE97_4C72_86C1_4534482B68C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I emigrated from an island in the Mediterranean—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫though not the same island as "
"you.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My country is a peculiar place, where candor and violence⟪k:6⟫go hand-in-hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono emigrato da un’isola nel Mediterraneo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫anche se non è la tua stessa isola."
"⟪k:3⟫ ⟪k:4⟫È⟪k:5⟫ un posto particolare, dove innocenza e violenza vanno⟪k:6⟫di pari passo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_89E12E69_00E2_4991_9BC3_106866F5EA0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4496b5220cc10b98e84e7cab9de80f2a90bd82fcc66ca28f9ff9a0cec3d48c39
#. default-sha256: fc6f60487cfbb6c8059989db164ee33ae25671486da517c4a7800aeef97d4d17
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_89E12E69_00E2_4991_9BC3_106866F5EA0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As a whole, the country is on the poor side,⟪k:2⟫and if nobody does anything about "
"that..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tutto sommato, il mio è un Paese povero,⟪k:2⟫e se nessuno farà nulla al riguardo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B2AA0A1_F2AE_4C56_91F8_D740CF672B9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92f4950a3649db85c7e31128aa65c78b1ec45bb9e1add24b66c9bf8bda550e81
#. default-sha256: 1c89213f0b18c1c1021265477639df5a2e704f64fc6b50bfa96335b8f09dcf35
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B2AA0A1_F2AE_4C56_91F8_D740CF672B9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I am one of but a few of my fellow countrymen who has set his sights on the New World. "
"⟪k:2⟫They are falling far behind other nations. ⟪k:3⟫If I find success here, perhaps that will "
"catch their attention."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sono uno tra i pochi abitanti della mia terra ad aver messo gli occhi⟪k:2⟫sul Nuovo "
"Mondo. ⟪k:3⟫Sta cadendo molto più in basso rispetto alle altre nazioni. ⟪k:4⟫Se avrò successo "
"qui, forse questo attirerà la loro attenzione."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3B5D426_171E_4310_AC2B_B01EA65000F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50eb3f082dfd452c2e8a79ce2b142a31b69658c6f4d6e4f9775ff90b5fae759e
