msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_48981926_293A_45C1_B023_00510856D107"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My feelings are... ⟪k:1⟫a little more complicated than mere love.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But that’s "
"nothing you need to concern yourself with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I miei sentimenti sono... ⟪k:1⟫un po’ più complessi del semplice amore.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma non è "
"nulla di cui tu debba preoccuparti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1DB632F4_7554_46D0_A33E_2DA69BFBC2FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a3d88f16c429f46b6ff2be41a8d1f4f06e901b9a4e5e0935d2b471cd4101f14
