msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1DB632F4_7554_46D0_A33E_2DA69BFBC2FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Well, I’ll have to remember not to get myself drunk around a woman again. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Forget everything I just said.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It’s about time we head back to the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Oh, beh, dovrò ricordarmi di non ubriacarmi di nuovo vicino a una donna. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Dimentica tutto quello che ho appena detto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ ora di tornare a casa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_761B2E64_834D_4CE4_A01D_18AAE716B778
